### Login as customer
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "jane.doe@example.com", "password": "Customer!Meridian2026"}

### Login as admin
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "admin@meridian.example", "password": "Admin!Meridian2026"}

### Browse catalog
GET http://localhost:8080/api/categories/outdoor/products?page=1&size=2

### Add to cart
POST http://localhost:8080/api/cart/items
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"productId": 202, "quantity": 1}

### Apply promo
POST http://localhost:8080/api/cart/promo?code=FALL15
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Checkout
POST http://localhost:8080/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"shippingAddressId": 5001, "currency": "USD", "paymentToken": "tok_visa"}

### Daily report
GET http://localhost:8080/api/reports/daily?from=2026-10-01&to=2026-10-07
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
